From 16cce2c2706177121943e139115b0b2c119f8f7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RoboClaw <roboclaw-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:33:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(setup): initialize missing account catalog before
 inference

Await provider-scoped discovery for read-only setup probes before capturing model facts. Preserve cancellation, config, and catalog persistence behavior; keep ordinary turns on their existing static path.

Co-authored-by: daniel-lxs <57051444+daniel-lxs@users.noreply.github.com>

